# Density Compare
# Silicon (Si) — real density 2.329 g/cm³. equal masses: Silicon vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Silicon Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 15.1mm color: #f0c8a0 at (-20mm, 7.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 18.6 g — the water cube is the reference
